9. The petitioner no. 1 had paid a sum of Rs. 3,00,000/- in three installments in the following manner:
a. First installment of Rs.1,00,000/- paid to respondent no.2 at the time recording of statement of first motion;
b. Second installment of Rs. 1,00,000/- paid to respondent no. 2 at the time of recording of statement of second motion;
c. Third/Final instalment of Rs. 1,00,000/- to be paid at the time of quashing of the FIR before the Honble High Court at New Delhi.
